    {
      "chunk_type": "opening",
      "arabic_text": "وَفِيهِ أَنَّ أَمِيرَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامِ كَانَ يَقُولُ فِي دُعَائِهِ: اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ بِاسْمِكَ الْعَظِيمِ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And in it is that the Commander of the Faithful (peace be upon him) used to say in his supplication: O God, I ask You by Your Great Name"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَبِاسْمِكَ الْأَعْظَمِ الَّذِي إِذَا سُئِلْتَ بِهِ أَعْطَيْتَ وَإِذَا دُعِيتَ بِهِ أَجَبْتَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And by Your Greatest Name, which when asked for You give, and when called upon You answer"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَبِاسْمِكَ الَّذِي فَتَحْتَ بِهِ أَبْوَابَ رَحْمَتِكَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And by Your Name through which You opened the gates of Your mercy"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "وَبِاسْمِكَ الَّذِي أَشْرَقَتْ بِهِ الْأَرْضُ بِنُورِكَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "And by Your Name through which the earth shines with Your light"
